# -------- Sentry (error tracking) --------
# Optional — only needed if you enabled Sentry. Get these from
# https://sentry.io -> Settings -> Projects -> <project> -> Client Keys, then
# merge into .env.local. The error handler reports unhandled errors when
# @sentry/node is installed and SENTRY_DSN is set; without a DSN it no-ops.
SENTRY_DSN=
SENTRY_ORG=
SENTRY_PROJECT=
